<p>
	 
</p>

<p>
	As a donor, you have the flexibility to make a general contribution that allows us to allocate funds where they are needed most or to direct your gift to a specific cause close to your heart. Here are some of the programs you can choose to support:
</p>

<p>
	<b>Emergency Transportation Assistance</b>: Covers travel and gas expenses for those in urgent need. <b>Move That Mountain Fund</b>: Provides immediate aid to working individuals facing financial emergencies. <b>Essential Goods Program</b>: Distributes food, hygiene products, and household necessities to families. <b>Seasonal Initiatives</b>: Includes the Senior Angel Tree, Camp Keystone for youth, and the Smart Start School Supply drive.
</p>

<p>
	<b><u>Special Programs for Active Engagement</u></b><u>:</u>
</p>

<p>
	<span style="tab-stops:list .5in;"><b><span style="color:red;">Camp Keystone</span></b><span style="color:red;">: </span>In 2024, Camp Keystone provided nine underprivileged children a four-day adventure filled with activities designed to spark wonder and excitement</span> <span style="tab-stops:list .5in;"><b><span style="color:red;">Smart Start for School</span></b><span style="color:red;">: </span>We bring smiles to children from low-income families by providing them with essential school supplies and backpacks, thanks to the support of local businesses and individuals.</span> <span style="tab-stops:list .5in;"><b><span style="color:red;">Senior Angel Tree</span></b><span style="color:red;">: </span>This initiative supports low-income seniors during the Christmas season by collaborating with local groups, churches, and businesses to fulfill their holiday wish lists, thereby spreading joy and hope.</span>
</p></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>